OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after woman found
OL,4,Adead in caravan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder following the death of a woman.
OL,9,FNorthamptonshire Police was called to a
OL,10,Fcaravan park on Ecton Lane, Sywell, at
OL,11,Fabout 06:20 BST following reports of an
OL,12,Fassault.
OL,14,FWhen officers arrived they found the
OL,15,Fbody of a woman inside a caravan.
OL,17,FA 72-year-old man has been arrested and
OL,18,Ftaken into police custody.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
